Retain every exact arithmetic vector and division handshake check;
add multiplier request/response, two-edge completion, all sign
combinations, live-input mutation, sticky result and reset checks.

Prove the new eight-bit prefix identity, divisor guards and bounded
remainder alongside existing recurrence and zero-divisor proofs;
retain the arithmetic assertions and the eight-edge deadline.

